  "승인은 SUPER(본인 청구 불가) · 지급 처리는 지급 담당(본인 불가) · 간이영수증은 부가세 공제가 안 됩니다.": "Approval is by a SUPER (not for your own claim) · payment is marked by the payout officer (not for your own claim) · simple receipts are not eligible for VAT deduction.",
